# VS Code REST Client (extension: humao.rest-client). Click "Send Request".

@host = http://localhost:8000

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness (DB + Redis)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Register a new bidder
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "charlie", "password": "charlie123" }

### Log in as the seeded admin
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin1234" }

@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List auctions
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auctions

### Create an auction (admin)
# @name createAuction
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/auctions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Test Lot",
  "description": "Created from requests.http",
  "starting_price": "1000.00",
  "min_increment": "50.00",
  "starts_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "ends_at": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

@auctionId = {{createAuction.response.body.auction_id}}

### Start it
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/auctions/{{auctionId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Place a bid
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auctions/{{auctionId}}/bids
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

{ "amount": "1050.00" }

### Same idempotency key again -> same bid, no duplicate
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auctions/{{auctionId}}/bids
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Idempotency-Key: 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

{ "amount": "1050.00" }

### Bid history
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auctions/{{auctionId}}/bids

### Integrity check
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/auctions/{{auctionId}}/integrity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Live metrics (JSON)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/metrics/live
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{host}}/metrics
